  <prompt>Migrate SummarizeFilesWizard to consume WizardFollowOns and delete its SummaryNextStepsStep + SummarizeSendEmailStep copies. Its summary-oriented card set is expressed as a FollowOnCardConfig[], not a fork.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE shared-UI developer. Follow §11.</role>
  <goal>SummarizeFilesDialog renders Next Steps via WizardFollowOns; its duplicate copies removed; summarize flow + follow-ons unchanged.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>design §5.9. SummarizeFilesWizard has SummaryNextStepsStep + SummarizeSendEmailStep. If its cards are summary-specific, register them as FollowOnCardConfig entries (extend the shared step set if genuinely needed, don't fork the grid).</background>
